      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::You confidently place your hands on the crate and give it a go. Without much resistance you move the crate out of the way. Then, you crouch under the half-way opened gate and try lifting it. You hear scratching and grinding as you push it all the way up, where it stays stuck once you release it and take a step back.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
